msgid "内核验证"
msgstr "Kernel Validation"

msgid "定向检查"
msgstr "Targeted Checks"

msgid "从本仓运行受影响目标；作为父仓子模块时 TMPDIR 使用父仓 out/tmp::"
msgstr ""
"Run affected targets from this repository; when used as a parent repository's submodule, set "
"TMPDIR to the parent's out/tmp::"

msgid ""
"module-layout 检查本地 Kbuild、重复/遗漏对象、生产实现包含和上游引擎摘要。 宿主工具/ASan/UBSan、头导出、自包含 C/C++、ELF 和真实运行是不同层次。 ABI"
" 变化必须明确审查，不通过重生成历史 golden 消除差异。"
msgstr ""
"module-layout checks local Kbuild files, duplicate/missing objects, inclusion of production "
"implementations, and upstream engine digests. Host tools/ASan/UBSan, header exports, self-"
"contained C/C++, ELF, and actual execution are distinct layers. ABI changes require explicit "
"review, not regeneration of historical golden data to eliminate differences."

msgid "测试归属"
msgstr "Test Ownership"

msgid ""
"``tools/test_*.py``、``tools/tests/`` 与 ``tests/host/`` 保存内核实现、 驱动、文件系统、调度、内存管理和 Linux UAPI "
"的宿主测试、原生系统调用探针、 夹具及参考头。它们使用本仓源码与头文件，不依赖 ReliefOS 父仓的用户态或 构建目录。固定 syscall 表及其维护生成器也由本仓持有。"
msgstr ""
"``tools/test_*.py``, ``tools/tests/``, and ``tests/host/`` hold host tests, native syscall probes,"
" fixtures, and reference headers for kernel implementations, drivers, filesystems, scheduling, "
"memory management, and Linux UAPI. They use this repository's source and headers without depending"
" on ReliefOS userspace or build directories. This repository also owns the fixed syscall table and"
" its maintenance generator."

msgid "独立 checkout 或源码归档中可运行::"
msgstr "In a standalone checkout or source archive, run::"

msgid ""
"``tools/tests/host-suites.list`` 显式登记宿主套件和必要参数；runner 保留各套件 日志及 "
"``results.json``，任何失败均返回非零，后续套件仍会执行以形成完整报告。 ``test-host-smoke`` 是 CI 中的定向门禁；完整 ``test`` 还包括所有宿主套件、"
" ABI golden、导出头、启动、vDSO、徽标、panic、Kconfig 和模块布局检查。 仅有 Linux 参考探针通过，不表示相同接口已在 ReliefNT 来宾运行通过。"
msgstr ""
"``tools/tests/host-suites.list`` explicitly registers host suites and required arguments. The "
"runner retains suite logs and ``results.json``, returns nonzero for any failure, and continues "
"later suites for a complete report. ``test-host-smoke`` is a targeted CI gate; full ``test`` also "
"includes all host suites, ABI golden, exported headers, boot, vDSO, logo, panic, Kconfig, and "
"module layout checks. A passing Linux reference probe does not mean the same interface passed in a"
" ReliefNT guest."

msgid ""
"``procfs`` 套件执行真实 proc/VFS/fdinfo 的 ASan/UBSan 夹具，并在宿主 Linux 编译运行 ``tools/tests/procfs_probe.c`` "
"作为 ABI 参考。探针检查系统/进程节点、 seek、maps、二进制 auxv、描述符和多线程 thread-self；来宾验证应由操作系统 使用其 SDK "
"编译该探针后实际运行，并与宿主结果分别记录。"
msgstr ""
"The ``procfs`` suite runs ASan/UBSan fixtures for actual proc/VFS/fdinfo and compiles/runs "
"``tools/tests/procfs_probe.c`` on host Linux as an ABI reference. The probe checks system/process "
"nodes, seek, maps, binary auxv, descriptors, and multithreaded thread-self. For guest validation, "
"the OS should compile it with its SDK and actually execute it, recording guest and host results "
"separately."

msgid ""
"同套件还运行无需 libc 的 ``tools/tests/procfs_raw_probe.c``。该探针可编译为 initramfs 的 ``/init``，通过 "
"``rdinit=/init`` 在真实挂载的 procfs 上验收； PID 1 将结果写入串口并等待。编译示例::"
msgstr ""
"The same suite also runs libc-free ``tools/tests/procfs_raw_probe.c``. It can be built as an "
"initramfs ``/init`` and booted with ``rdinit=/init`` to validate actually mounted procfs; PID 1 "
"writes results to serial and waits. Build example::"

msgid "来宾验收分别记录单核和多核启动的完整串口日志、内核与探针摘要； 出现 PASS 后仍需检查没有 FAIL 或 panic，不能只以启动完成代替 syscall 验证。"
msgstr ""
"Guest acceptance records full serial logs and kernel/probe digests separately for single-core and "
"multicore boots. Even after PASS, check for any FAIL or panic; boot completion alone does not "
"validate syscalls."

msgid "``service_roles`` 套件检查旧内核桌面实现未恢复、旧窗口服务权限标志未恢复， 以及 exec 只保留允许的任务标志；这些内核源码检查由本仓持有，父仓不再重复。"
msgstr ""
"The ``service_roles`` suite checks that legacy in-kernel desktop implementations and old window-"
"service permission flags have not returned, and that exec preserves only permitted task flags. "
"This repository owns these kernel source checks; the parent no longer duplicates them."

msgid ""
"``syscall_io`` 套件覆盖真实设备节点标志组合下的 ``/dev/null`` 写入、访问模式、 ``O_PATH`` 和 Linux ``MAX_RW_COUNT`` "
"上限，避免通用设备分片截短空设备写入。 其原生探针 ``tools/tests/syscall_io_runtime_probe.c`` 编译后可用 ``--null`` 单独检查大块写入、原始 "
"write syscall、dup 和 writev；默认模式继续运行综合 POSIX I/O 检查。宿主 Linux 参考运行与 ReliefNT 来宾执行分别记录。"
msgstr ""
"The ``syscall_io`` suite covers ``/dev/null`` writes under actual device-node flag combinations, "
"access modes, ``O_PATH``, and Linux's ``MAX_RW_COUNT`` limit, preventing generic device chunking "
"from truncating null-device writes. Its native ``tools/tests/syscall_io_runtime_probe.c`` can be "
"compiled and run with ``--null`` to check large writes, raw write syscalls, dup, and writev alone;"
" default mode retains comprehensive POSIX I/O checks. Record host Linux reference and ReliefNT "
"guest runs separately."

msgid ""
"``test-smp-time``、``test-page-cache-growth``、``test-user-return``、 ``test-syscall-io``、``test-"
"vdso-host`` 和 ``test-version`` 提供定向入口。 ``make test-ext4-reference LINUX_REFERENCE=<目录>`` 检查 ext4 "
"schema， 需要已有 Linux 参考树； 它不会下载参考源码。互操作检查需要宿主 ``e2fsprogs``。 音频探针 ``--build-guest`` 需要显式传入由操作系统提供的 "
"``--sdk``。"
msgstr ""
"``test-smp-time``, ``test-page-cache-growth``, ``test-user-return``, ``test-syscall-io``, ``test-"
"vdso-host``, and ``test-version`` provide targeted entry points. ``make test-ext4-reference "
"LINUX_REFERENCE=<目录>`` checks ext4 schemas and requires an existing Linux reference tree; it does "
"not download reference source. Interoperability checks require host ``e2fsprogs``. Audio probe "
"``--build-guest`` requires explicitly passing the OS-provided ``--sdk``."

msgid "兼容性基线"
msgstr "Compatibility Baseline"

msgid ""
"``tools/tests/abi_layout_golden.json`` 保留原始布局基线； ``tools/tests/fixtures/legacy-abi-layout.json`` "
"保存旧导出面的原始布局记录， 迁移时逐字保留，两份均不能通过重生成来掩盖布局变化。 驱动服务表版本 2 的 17 个追加字段在 ``tools/tests/fixtures/driver-"
"api-v2.json`` 单独冻结：168 字节旧前缀的类型与 偏移仍与原始基线比较，当前服务表总长为 304 字节、对齐为 8。 ``make test-abi`` "
"同时检查旧前缀与追加字段，版本、大小、偏移和类型变化 均需显式审查。``abi_layout_checks`` 套件包含对应的失败反例；驱动管理器的 ``driver_modules`` "
"套件验证旧版本、未知版本和错误描述符大小在 init 前被拒绝。 这不表示版本 1 驱动二进制能在版本 2 内核运行。"
msgstr ""
"``tools/tests/abi_layout_golden.json`` retains the original layout baseline; "
"``tools/tests/fixtures/legacy-abi-layout.json`` records the original legacy export layout. "
"Preserve both verbatim during migration; neither may be regenerated to conceal layout changes. The"
" driver service table version 2's 17 appended fields are frozen separately in "
"``tools/tests/fixtures/driver-api-v2.json``. Types and offsets in the 168-byte legacy prefix are "
"still compared to the original baseline; the current table is 304 bytes with alignment 8. ``make "
"test-abi`` checks both the prefix and appended fields; version, size, offset, and type changes "
"require explicit review. ``abi_layout_checks`` includes corresponding negative cases; the driver "
"manager's ``driver_modules`` suite verifies rejection of old/unknown versions and incorrect "
"descriptor sizes before init. This does not mean version 1 driver binaries run on version 2 "
"kernels."

msgid ""
"音频 ioctl 支持清单为 ``configs/audio-abi-support.json``。 宿主门禁检查标志类型、构建前提、证据路径和验证范围；来宾、上游 ALSA 与 "
"硬件声明必须有对应说明，缺少证据声明的反例应失败。清单保留已有的验证标志 和未解决项；这些静态检查不重新执行历史来宾测试，不构成新的运行验收。 ``linux_audio`` 的 "
"ASan/UBSan 探针遇到未定义行为立即失败，不将带有 sanitizer 错误的零退出状态计为通过；PCM 回归覆盖尚无 DMA 缓冲区时的 DROP。"
msgstr ""
"The audio ioctl support manifest is ``configs/audio-abi-support.json``. Host gates check flag "
"types, build prerequisites, evidence paths, and validation scope. Guest, upstream ALSA, and "
"hardware claims require corresponding descriptions; negative cases lacking evidence declarations "
"must fail. The manifest retains existing validation flags and unresolved items. These static "
"checks do not rerun historical guest tests or constitute new runtime acceptance. The "
"``linux_audio`` ASan/UBSan probe fails immediately on undefined behavior and does not count a zero"
" exit status with sanitizer errors as a pass; PCM regressions cover DROP before a DMA buffer "
"exists."

msgid ""
"``sched_wakeup`` 套件覆盖生产调度唤醒与 SMP IPI 的逻辑 CPU/APIC 映射、启动 交接、合并通知、本地 IRQ 状态、离线/单核及停止/vfork 任务边界。输入 "
"IRQ 夹具另检查重新调度向量不会被当成 timer 或 PIC 中断。I/O 预算测试在旧 uptime 停止增长时检查续传、偏移与完整结果；vDSO/timekeeper 测试区分内部 CPU"
" 本地工作计数与用户可见时钟。framebuffer 的 guard-page 夹具检查精确 像素范围、未对齐来源和行尾边界，既有 FIFO 满时的损伤重试仍须通过。"
msgstr ""
"The ``sched_wakeup`` suite covers logical CPU/APIC mappings for production scheduler wakeups and "
"SMP IPIs, boot handoff, notification coalescing, local IRQ state, offline/single-core cases, and "
"stopped/vfork task boundaries. Input IRQ fixtures also check that reschedule vectors are not "
"treated as timer or PIC interrupts. I/O budget tests check resumption, offsets, and complete "
"results when legacy uptime stops advancing; vDSO/timekeeper tests distinguish internal CPU-local "
"work counters from user-visible clocks. Framebuffer guard-page fixtures check exact pixel ranges, "
"unaligned sources, and line-end boundaries; existing damage retries when the FIFO is full must "
"still pass."

msgid ""
"同一调度套件检查 IRQ 延迟时的公平时间计费、ACPI PM 回绕及源切换；APIC 夹具检查 100/250/1000 Hz "
"的计数与失败回退。``private_fault_transactions`` 使用真实缺页分发、页表和返回谓词，检查无抢占请求时的私有页直接恢复， "
"以及远端通知、信号、停止、亲和性和失效帧仍进入调度路径。"
msgstr ""
"The same scheduler suite checks fair time charging during IRQ delays, ACPI PM wraparound, and "
"source switching; APIC fixtures check counts and failure fallback at 100/250/1000 Hz. "
"``private_fault_transactions`` uses actual fault dispatch, page tables, and return predicates to "
"check direct private-page restoration without preemption requests, while remote notifications, "
"signals, stops, affinity, and invalid frames still take the scheduling path."

msgid ""
"``process_priority`` 使用真实 syscall 分发验证 PRIO_PROCESS 的同属主父进程 "
"降优先级、跨属主拒绝、CAP_SYS_NICE、升优先级拒绝、数值钳制、ESRCH 和 Linux 返回值编码；不修改宿主进程的调度状态。整机还需验证 XDM/IceWM "
"与用户终端分别继承预期优先级，不能以临时 root 提权实验代替启动链检查。"
msgstr ""
"``process_priority`` uses actual syscall dispatch to validate PRIO_PROCESS priority lowering by a "
"same-owner parent, cross-owner denial, CAP_SYS_NICE, priority-raising denial, value clamping, "
"ESRCH, and Linux return encoding, without changing host process scheduling. Full-system validation"
" must also check expected inherited priorities for XDM/IceWM and user terminals separately; "
"temporary root escalation experiments cannot replace boot-chain checks."

msgid ""
"``pat`` 套件覆盖生产 PAT 引导/AP 策略及真实页表的 UC 到 WC 转换： 功能缺失、固件布局、写回读失败、冲突别名/租约、RAM、用户页表阶段与 失败原子性。VMware "
"引导夹具检查可预取 BAR、FIFO 交叠和模式切换策略； SVGA 夹具检查 FIFO 初始化不把已保留的 WC 显存重新声明为 UC。"
msgstr ""
"The ``pat`` suite covers production PAT boot/AP policy and UC-to-WC transitions in actual page "
"tables: missing features, firmware layouts, write/readback failures, conflicting aliases/leases, "
"RAM, user-page-table stages, and failure atomicity. VMware boot fixtures check prefetchable BARs, "
"FIFO overlap, and mode transition policy; SVGA fixtures check FIFO initialization does not "
"redeclare reserved WC video memory as UC."

msgid "目标运行"
msgstr "Target Execution"

msgid ""
"启动检查固件与内核完成、PID 1；系统调用探针必须实际进入来宾。 panic 验证还需真实异常与画面，徽标需检查数量、留距和移除。 主仓提供集成 QEMU "
"工具，但它们不是本仓新增产品；每次记录源码与二进制 摘要，保留源镜像。VMware 与物理硬件未验证不能记作通过。"
msgstr ""
"Boot checks cover firmware and kernel completion and PID 1; syscall probes must actually enter the"
" guest. Panic validation also requires real exceptions and screen output; logos require count, "
"spacing, and removal checks. The main repository provides integrated QEMU tools, but they are not "
"new products of this repository. Record source and binary digests each time and retain source "
"images. Unvalidated VMware and physical hardware must not be marked passed."
